    codeExample: { language: "text", code: "Classic trap: a shirt's price increases by 20%, then decreases by 20%.\nIs the final price back to the original?\n\nOriginal price: 100\nAfter +20%: 120\nAfter -20% of 120 (NOT of 100): 120 - 24 = 96\n\nFinal price is 96, not 100 - because the second percentage was\ncalculated on the NEW base (120), not the original (100)." },
