    interviewTips: ["Be ready to explain WHY compilers use an intermediate representation (front-end/back-end reuse across languages and architectures) - a genuinely important architectural insight beyond just naming the phase", "Know LLVM as a concrete, real-world example of exactly this shared-IR architecture in production use, if the discussion goes toward real compiler infrastructure"],
