    commonMistakes: ["Assuming a rented 'virtual machine' from a cloud provider has genuinely dedicated, exclusive physical hardware, when it's actually one of many VMs sharing physical hardware, carefully isolated by the hypervisor", "Confusing Type 1 (bare-metal, data-center-grade) and Type 2 (application-level, personal-computer-grade) hypervisors and their genuinely different performance/use-case profiles"],
