    codeExample: { language: "text", code: "Linear Regression: predicted_price = w1*sqft + w2*bedrooms + b\n\nCost function (Mean Squared Error):\n  MSE = average of (predicted_price - actual_price)^2\n  across all training examples\n\nTraining = adjusting w1, w2, b via gradient descent to MINIMIZE this MSE" },
