    commonMistakes: ["Treating each ML concept as an isolated, disconnected fact to memorize, rather than recognizing shared underlying ideas (like gradient descent) connecting concepts across this entire subject", "Being unable to explain WHY raw accuracy can mislead on imbalanced data, only being able to define precision/recall abstractly without the concrete, motivating example"],
