    codeExample: { language: "text", code: "Hard real-time example: anti-lock braking system\n  -> MUST respond within a strict deadline, every single time\n  -> missing the deadline = genuine safety failure\n\nSoft real-time example: video streaming buffer\n  -> should respond quickly, but an occasional delay just causes\n     a brief stutter, not a catastrophic failure" },
